WEBVTT

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:09.230
We have reports of crustal movement and abnormal weather all over the world!

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:15.240
The breaking of the seal on the Legendary Aquarion is affecting the whole planet.

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:18.530
And we can't contact the Elements, either!

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:21.370
Our only option is to send the machines we have left to Altair!

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:25.120
But how? The Dimension Gate is closed!

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.880
I'll open a hole through the dimensions.

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:32.090
I know last time was an accident, and Shrade was there to help...

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:36.020
But... it worked!

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:37.390
Can you do it, Andy?

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:41.890
If I don't, all the holes I've ever dug would be pointless!

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:43.940
Let me go, Chairman!

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:49.000
Andy W. Hol...

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.500
We will gamble everything on your power.

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:14.510
You dare oppose me, Wings of the Sun?

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:24.400
Our goal is to secure the true Eve.

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:28.070
Avoid the core units! Disable their weapons!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:36.570
You really think that'll work, Izumo?

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:58.770
This is the power of the Wings of the Sun?

00:01:58.770 --> 00:01:59.590
But...

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:09.560
This is enough power to wipe out a Gnis platoon all at once.

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:11.870
I'll send it back at you amplified!

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:14.940
He's firing it back!

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:17.280
Then I'll just reverse it!

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:26.820
His power of reversal is canceling out my counter!

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:30.240
Izumo! You can't have my wench! Not even over my dead body!

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:32.050
What's the matter with you, Kagura?

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:34.550
Why do you care about that Rare Igura so much?

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:38.050
She's my smelly wench! Mine alone!

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:40.680
So childish!

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:43.430
Sir Izumo, I'll fight with you!

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:47.810
That Abductor...

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.940
No way! Mix?!

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:57.280
Sir Izumo is Altair's future!

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:02.450
Please be safe...

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:16.630
It's been a while since just us guys United!

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:20.130
We're about to reach the target!

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:23.370
Let's do this! With a manly Brutal Union!

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:25.210
That's not how we Unite!

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:28.140
We're doing a hot-blooded Warrior's Union!

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:28.980
Go!

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:31.020
Aquarion!

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:39.620
Aquarion Gepard!

00:03:50.140 --> 00:03:51.180
Mix!

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:55.040
It doesn't matter what your body's turned into!

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:57.340
I'll always come for you!

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:02.840
Remember what I used to say, Mix?

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:07.210
Holes are dug to bring the world together.

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:11.850
This hole's to bring us to the world where you are!

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:16.360
And I'll open another great big hole into your heart!

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:19.730
Big enough to bury myself in!

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:43.050
An artificial Dimension Gate has formed!

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:45.550
Go get 'em, boys!

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:58.650
Wait for me, Mix!

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:02.650
I heard someone calling my name!

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:07.410
No! My name is Mixy!

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:15.320
Outta my way!

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:16.080
Stop!

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:18.550
Mix is piloting that robot!

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:19.880
She's my friend!

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:21.410
Your friend?

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.130
Here he comes.

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:30.720
Damn you, Izumo.

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:33.940
Amata!

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:49.240
Amata...

00:05:50.630 --> 00:05:51.380
Who's there?

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:54.780
Amata...

00:05:56.510 --> 00:05:57.610
Amata!

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:08.010
Where is this?

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:09.550
Amata...

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:22.200
Cut it out!

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:25.990
Reverse!

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:28.100
Sir Izumo!

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:31.620
Reverse out of my sight!

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:38.620
I'll crush you!

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:39.750
Stop!

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:46.050
That robot!

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:47.920
You!

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.930
Aquarion Gepard!

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:52.370
Looks like we butted right into a fight.

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:54.510
Two Abductors and the Legendary Aquarion...

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:56.060
Who are the pilots?

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:57.930
Cayenne! Is that you, Cayenne?

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:01.190
Mikono! What are you doing with him?

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:02.440
Mix!

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:04.440
That's Mix's machine!

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:07.190
What the hell's going on?

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:10.950
Those two Abductors are trying to get Mikono!

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:12.970
Where are Amata and Shrade?

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:15.350
We lost Amata.

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:17.720
Shrade... is dead.

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:22.850
He played out his final song in the dimensional rift.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:28.010
So that's what it was...

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:43.520
Shrade...

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:48.150
You dare oppose Sir Izumo, too?

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:52.110
Wrong, Mix! I'm only here to take you back!

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:53.530
Take me back where?

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:56.240
Don't you remember?

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.290
It's me! Andy W. Hol!

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:04.290
Stop! I can't stand it!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.240
Mix!

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:15.050
Can't you see, Kagura? Don't you care about Altair?

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:17.240
Not one bit!

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:21.770
This planet can go to hell! I just want my smelly wench!

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:27.520
I'll fight the whole world before I give her up!

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:31.280
Mix! Mix!

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:36.180
All for a single Igura, a single woman...

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:40.410
Alicia...

00:08:48.850 --> 00:08:52.650
The voice is calling me from in there.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:54.800
Amata...

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:19.070
Mom!

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:21.560
Amata.

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:31.750
The planet, the land, and the life sleeping within.

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:35.700
They are all about to awaken.

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:40.920
The rebirth of the Wings of the Sun is a double-edged sword.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:48.470
Will it divide the world or reunite it?

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:59.450
Come back to me, Mix!

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:03.240
Spatial Augmentation!

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:05.930
Not again!

00:10:05.930 --> 00:10:08.040
How long are you going to keep this up?

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:10.130
I'll do this for as long as it takes!

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:14.960
I'll make the holes, and Mix'll fill them!

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:18.970
That's how we came to know each other!

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:30.710
Why does he keep doing the same pointless move?

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:33.380
And why does it feel so familiar?

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:39.980
Amata, I've waited so long to see you again.

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:43.990
You've grown.

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:50.830
It's too late for that now! You left me all alone!

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:54.960
Do you know how I've felt all these years?

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:59.340
And after all this time, you call for me...

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:03.020
Amata...

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:09.580
I won't ask you to forgive me.

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:12.320
But I have to tell you...

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:17.060
Why I had to leave you.

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:21.450
And about your father.

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:26.990
Your father isn't an Earthling.

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:33.210
He's Izumo Kamurogi, the commander of Altair.

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:39.250
Him?

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:47.810
I cannot afford to lose.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:53.670
I must put an end to the curse of Eve! The Rare Igura's tragedy!

00:11:54.250 --> 00:12:02.030
Your father came to Earth on a mission to find a
woman who could withstand interdimensional travel.

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:06.650
It was back when I was an actress.

00:12:57.820 --> 00:13:03.340
My machine malfunctioned and I
crashed on Vega. She saved my life.

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:10.500
It didn't take me long to realize that
Alicia was the Rare Igura we were looking for.

00:13:11.980 --> 00:13:12.730
But...

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:23.320
It took even less time for us to fall in love.

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:37.920
I'm in no position to judge Kagura.

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:43.960
I almost betrayed Altair once myself, for a single woman.

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:50.670
I kept her a secret from command, and we returned to Altair.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:55.450
But I couldn't keep it from Mikage.

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:10.120
He came back some years later. By then, I had you.

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:17.120
But when he told me about the curse of Eve...

00:14:18.510 --> 00:14:19.820
I'll come.

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:25.130
Are you sure? We don't know what will happen to a Rare Igura there.

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:29.890
If it'll help you, I'm sure.

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:32.640
Alicia...

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:43.540
It was hard to decide whether I should take you or not.

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:50.780
In the end, I was more worried that you would be in danger on a strange, unknown world.

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:56.740
I never thought we would be apart for so long.

00:14:57.730 --> 00:15:02.790
No, that's just an excuse. I abandoned you.

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:07.130
I wanted to help save my love's world.

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:10.050
It was all for the man and the things I loved.

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:25.770
I've resented you all this time.

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:32.410
But not anymore.

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:40.780
I just hate myself from back then, when all I could do was watch you leave.

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:47.750
You were brave enough to go after your love. I wasn't.

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:53.250
That's all there is to it, Mom.

00:15:54.690 --> 00:15:56.050
Amata...

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:13.740
Just give it up already, Izumo!

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:18.740
I will not lose! I will not let Alicia's sacrifice go to waste!

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:22.500
The Legendary Aquarion is fighting!

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:26.290
That's Izumo and the other you.

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:27.800
Kagura?

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:34.140
Ianthe, created by my mother Oriza!

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:51.000
What?

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:52.190
Red strings?

00:16:52.870 --> 00:16:57.580
He's focusing all of Altair's power into the Ahura Gnis!

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:07.080
Altair Cannon.

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:19.220
Fire.

00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:21.600
What the?

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:37.340
That was the power of the planet itself.

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:39.660
Damn you, Izumo.

00:17:44.360 --> 00:17:47.000
That was a warning shot.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:49.640
Give me the true Eve...

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:51.550
or I'll shoot for real.

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:55.550
Zessica?

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:57.610
What?

00:18:07.110 --> 00:18:08.230
That's...

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:16.360
Mom!

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:22.780
No...

00:18:27.530 --> 00:18:29.880
Kagura!

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:32.380
Alicia!

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:34.260
What the...?

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:35.700
Now.

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:46.890
Feel the power of the Genesis Infinity Punch!

00:18:56.450 --> 00:18:59.240
Farewell, Izumo.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:17.640
That power...

00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:21.760
So this was all your doing, Mikage!

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:24.060
What?

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:32.050
Silvie!

00:20:04.770 --> 00:20:06.540
Alicia...

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:09.350
Hang on!

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:20.140
I talked to Mom.

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:22.900
She told me about you.

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:24.940
I see.

00:20:31.450 --> 00:20:35.470
Take me to Alicia.

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:44.200
I can't ask you for forgiveness.

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:49.450
I took your mother from you.

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:56.360
What're those?

00:20:57.070 --> 00:20:58.470
Mayflies.

00:20:59.330 --> 00:21:02.780
I've only seen them once, when I was a boy.

00:21:03.760 --> 00:21:08.160
I thought they went extinct a long time ago when the females died off.

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:10.980
Why are they back now?

00:21:18.050 --> 00:21:20.610
We're in Area 337.

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:24.520
This is where Ianthe has had the most malfunctions.

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:29.550
Was Ianthe...

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:36.670
Mother Earth. The goddess of the fertile land.

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:43.300
The land that brings forth the blessing of the harvest is symbolized by a feminine figure.

00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:47.770
Male and female. Positive and negative.

00:21:47.770 --> 00:21:53.140
All of creation is ordered along these dualities.

00:21:53.910 --> 00:21:58.050
From people to lands. From worlds to the universe itself.

00:21:59.650 --> 00:22:04.010
Ianthe functioned by drawing energy from the earth.

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:11.070
In doing so, perhaps it took away the mothering power of the land as well.

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:14.140
If so...

00:22:14.800 --> 00:22:17.560
All of this was because of Ianthe.

00:22:18.960 --> 00:22:21.450
And all I have ever done...

00:22:22.130 --> 00:22:23.980
was for naught.

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:29.990
Hold on! Not when we just met!

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:33.760
Dad! Dad!

00:22:37.790 --> 00:22:39.550
It wasn't for naught.

00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:46.630
Mom!

00:22:51.260 --> 00:22:52.470
Alicia!

00:22:53.400 --> 00:22:56.680
Your life meant something.

00:22:56.680 --> 00:23:00.020
There's still Amata.

00:23:00.020 --> 00:23:03.380
He is the hope for the two worlds.

00:23:06.420 --> 00:23:07.450
Amata...

00:23:08.590 --> 00:23:11.160
You are the symbol of our love.

00:23:12.260 --> 00:23:15.160
Amata, you need to love, too.

00:23:15.780 --> 00:23:20.290
Love the one person more precious to you than anyone else.

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:27.760
Mom!

00:24:11.000 --> 00:24:13.970
My destined smelly wench.

00:24:13.970 --> 00:24:16.280
I know your real name.

00:24:16.280 --> 00:24:17.810
I love you.

00:24:18.310 --> 00:24:21.670
I love you, Silvie!

00:24:21.670 --> 00:24:24.650
I want to take and hold all of you.
